READING: NO in every row => the extremal adversary CANNOT cover q* within its own
magnitude (freedom<q* per runner blocks the alignment) => q_min=q* is FORCED at the
extremal. The compressed crux at the extremal reduces to `the forced residues don't
cover Z/q*`, and here the adversary provably can't force a cover without more magnitude.
